        "AbstractText": "First Person is a series of interviews with the first authors of a selection of papers published in Journal of Cell Science, helping early-career researchers promote themselves alongside their papers. Meraj Hasan Khan is the first author on 'The Sharpin interactome reveals a role for Sharpin in lamellipodium formation via the Arp2/3 complex', published in Journal of Cell Science. Meraj is a PhD student in the laboratory of Jeroen Pouwel at the University of Turku, Finland, investigating the cytoskeleton and protein early markers of metastasis."
